sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant API Gateway
    participant Eureka
    participant Microservice (Employee)
    participant Database

    Client->>API Gateway: GET /api/v1/employees/1 (Header: Bearer Token)
    API Gateway->>API Gateway: JwtAuthenticationFilter Validates Token
    API Gateway->>Eureka: Fetch instance for 'employee-service'
    Eureka-->>API Gateway: Return EmployeeService IP & Port
    API Gateway->>Microservice (Employee): Route Request (Load Balanced)
    Microservice (Employee)->>Microservice (Employee): Controller -> Service -> Repository
    Microservice (Employee)->>Database: SELECT * FROM employees WHERE id = 1
    Database-->>Microservice (Employee): ResultSet
    Microservice (Employee)-->>API Gateway: 200 OK (Employee DTO)
    API Gateway-->>Client: 200 OK (JSON Data)
